window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>They were never meant to survive...</b></p> <p>After years apart, Allette finally found her prince, only for both of them to be cast out of the fae realm. Now, stranded and destitute, she soon learns that Senan has been keeping secrets, and the consequences are grim indeed.</p> <p>Senan escaped one dire fate only to find himself on the brink of another. His only hope now resides in Kumulus, but so does the man who wants him dead.</p> <p>If either of them is caught, their lives and the love they fought so hard to save will be cut off before they've really begun.</p>"; 
